# ScrubField 拖拽数值域

## 基础用法

### ScrubField

:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="ScrubFieldScrubFieldDemo" code-lang="vue" title="三种量纲" description="整数、百分比、半步长；三条输入路径都可用。"}
---
code: |
  <script setup lang="ts">
  import { ref } from 'vue'

  const width = ref(324)
  const opacity = ref(100)
  </script>

  <template>
    <TxScrubField v-model="width" label="宽" :min="40" :max="999" :active="width !== 324" />
    <TxScrubField v-model="opacity" label="不透明度" :min="0" :max="100" suffix="%" />
  </template>
---
